{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 面试攻略 MOC | 智能体开发工程师面试手册","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"高频反问问题清单\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>guide\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"面试攻略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> interview/questions\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/guide\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"面试攻略 MOC\" href=\"面试攻略 MOC\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试攻略 MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"智能体开发工程师面试手册\" href=\"智能体开发工程师面试手册\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">智能体开发工程师面试手册</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"高频反问问题清单\" dir=\"auto\">高频反问问题清单</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"一、为什么要反问？\" dir=\"auto\">一、为什么要反问？</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">反问不仅是了解公司的机会，更是展示你<strong>思考深度</strong>和<strong>职业素养</strong>的方式。一个好的反问能给面试官留下深刻印象。</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid\"><svg id=\"mca24cb8765eabb1e\" width=\"734\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"flowchart\" height=\"169\" viewBox=\"0 0 734 169\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\"><style>#mca24cb8765eabb1e{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;fill:#333;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .error-icon{fill:#552222;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .error-text{fill:#552222;stroke:#552222;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:1px;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-thickness-invisible{stroke-width:0;fill:none;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .marker{fill:#333333;stroke:#333333;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .marker.cross{stroke:#333333;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e svg{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e p{margin:0;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .label{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);color:#333;}#mca24cb8765eabb1e .cluster-label text{fill:#333;}#mca24cb8765